        "reference": "After business COMMIT+idle ReadyForQuery, the two frontend messages are standalone Sync. The second is the coordinator recovery phase, after driver confirmation published Committed. Its failure discards the physical lease; next request opens another backend and returns the identical durable201 replay.",
